---
interface Props {
  lang?: 'tr' | 'en';
}

const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const isEnglish = lang === 'en';
---

<div class="about-page">
  <header class="about-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">TheosDev / {isEnglish ? 'About' : 'Hakkımda'}</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">{isEnglish ? 'Game systems, built from the inside out.' : 'Oyun sistemlerini içeriden dışarıya kuruyorum.'}</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">{isEnglish ? 'I am Nazım Beyaz, a Unity and C# game programmer focused on gameplay systems, multiplayer experiments, and rapid prototyping.' : 'Ben Nazım Beyaz. Gameplay sistemleri, multiplayer deneyleri ve hızlı prototipleme üzerine çalışan Unity ve C# oyun programcısıyım.'}</p>
  </header>

  <section class="about-columns" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">01 — {isEnglish ? 'Approach' : 'Yaklaşım'}</p><h2 id="approach-title">{isEnglish ? 'Make the core idea playable early.' : 'Temel fikri erken oynanabilir hale getirmek.'}</h2></div>
    <div><p>{isEnglish ? 'I like the space between design intent and technical structure. I test the central interaction quickly, learn from the result, then build the architecture that can survive iteration.' : 'Tasarım fikri ile teknik yapı arasındaki alanı seviyorum. Temel etkileşimi hızlıca test eder, sonuçtan öğrenir ve iterasyonlara dayanacak mimariyi kurarım.'}</p><p>{isEnglish ? 'My main work is in Unity and C#: state-driven gameplay, combat loops, multiplayer state, editor tools, and the practical systems that keep a prototype moving.' : 'Ana çalışma alanım Unity ve C#: state-driven gameplay, savaş döngüleri, multiplayer state, editör araçları ve prototipi hareket halinde tutan pratik sistemler.'}</p></div>
  </section>

  <figure class="about-feature-image" data-prealpha-gallery>
    <div class="about-gallery-frame">
      <img class="is-visible" src="/media/shadow-shift-prealpha-terminal.png" alt={isEnglish ? 'Shadow Shift Pre-Alpha terminal scene' : 'Shadow Shift Pre-Alpha terminal sahnesi'} />
      <img src="/media/shadow-shift-prealpha-corridor.png" alt={isEnglish ? 'Shadow Shift Pre-Alpha corridor scene' : 'Shadow Shift Pre-Alpha koridor sahnesi'} />
      <img src="/media/shadow-shift-prealpha-id-card.png" alt={isEnglish ? 'Shadow Shift Pre-Alpha identity card scene' : 'Shadow Shift Pre-Alpha kimlik kartı sahnesi'} />
      <img src="/media/shadow-shift-prealpha-notice.png" alt={isEnglish ? 'Shadow Shift Pre-Alpha notice scene' : 'Shadow Shift Pre-Alpha duyuru sahnesi'} />
    </div>
    <figcaption>{isEnglish ? 'Shadow Shift / Pre-Alpha — a first playable Nightwatch shift.' : 'Shadow Shift / Pre-Alpha — Nightwatch için ilk oynanabilir vardiya.'}</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="toolkit-title">
    <div class="section-label"><h2 id="toolkit-title">{isEnglish ? 'Toolkit' : 'Teknik araç seti'}</h2><span>02 — 04</span></div>
    <div class="resume-grid">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Game development</h3><p>Unity, C#, gameplay systems, state machines, physics, combat, procedural progression.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Networked play</h3><p>Netcode for GameObjects, asymmetric state sync, multiplayer lobbies, Vivox, UGS cloud replay.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Tools and products</h3><p>Unity editor scripting, Flutter, Dart, SQLite, React, WebRTC, Socket.io, practical web tools.</p></article>
    </div>

    <script>
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-prealpha-gallery]').forEach((gallery) => {
        const images = Array.from(gallery.querySelectorAll<HTMLImageElement>('.about-gallery-frame img'));
        let activeIndex = 0;
        window.setInterval(() => {
          images[activeIndex]?.classList.remove('is-visible');
          activeIndex = (activeIndex + 1) % images.length;
          images[activeIndex]?.classList.add('is-visible');
        }, 45000);
      });
    </script>

    <style>
      .about-feature-image { margin: 58px 0 0; }
      .about-gallery-frame { position: relative; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #101311; }
      .about-gallery-frame img { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 1400ms ease; }
      .about-gallery-frame img.is-visible { opacity: 1; }      .about-feature-image figcaption { color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; margin-top: 10px; }
    </style>
  </section>

  <section class="about-columns resume-section" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">03 — {isEnglish ? 'Experience format' : 'Üretim biçimi'}</p><h2 id="experience-title">{isEnglish ? 'Small teams, clear ownership.' : 'Küçük ekipler, net sorumluluk.'}</h2></div>
    <div><p>{isEnglish ? 'My portfolio is built from solo projects, game jam collaborations, prototypes, and small products. Each project is presented around the system I owned and the problem I explored.' : 'Portfolyom solo projeler, game jam ekipleri, prototipler ve küçük ürünlerden oluşuyor. Her projeyi sahip olduğum sistem ve incelediğim problem etrafında anlatıyorum.'}</p><a class="text-link" href={isEnglish ? '/en/projects' : '/projects'}>{isEnglish ? 'See the project archive' : 'Proje arşivini gör'} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="about-contact-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">04 — {isEnglish ? 'Open to conversation' : 'İletişime açık'}</p>
    <h2 id="about-contact-title">{isEnglish ? 'Let’s talk about the system behind the idea.' : 'Fikrin arkasındaki sistemi konuşalım.'}</h2>
    <a class="button button-dark" href="mailto:nazimbeyaz11@gmail.com">nazimbeyaz11@gmail.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </section>
</div>
